# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pauli propagation {#pauli-propagation}"
msgstr "Pauli propagation {#pauli-propagation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `pauli-prop` package provides a Rust-accelerated Python interface for performing Pauli propagation.\n"
msgstr "Paket `pauli-prop` menyediakan antarmuka Python yang dipercepat dengan Rust untuk melakukan Pauli propagation.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pauli propagation is a framework for approximating the evolution of operators in the Pauli basis under the action of other operators, such as quantum circuit gates and noise channels. This approach can be effective when the operators involved are expected to remain sparse in the Pauli basis.\n"
msgstr "Pauli propagation adalah kerangka kerja untuk mengaproksimasi evolusi operator dalam basis Pauli di bawah aksi operator lain, seperti gate circuit kuantum dan noise channel. Pendekatan ini bisa efektif ketika operator yang terlibat diperkirakan tetap sparse dalam basis Pauli.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The subroutines in this package may be used to implement error mitigation techniques such as [lightcone shading](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc) [\\[6\\]](#references) and [propagated noise absorption](/addons/qiskit-addon-pna) [\\[7\\]](#references), [operator backpropagation](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp) [\\[8\\]](#references) for circuit depth reduction, and classical simulation of expectation values [\\[1-5\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "Subrutin di paket ini bisa dipakai untuk mengimplementasikan teknik error mitigation seperti [lightcone shading](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc) [\\[6\\]](#references) dan [propagated noise absorption](/addons/qiskit-addon-pna) [\\[7\\]](#references), [operator backpropagation](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp) [\\[8\\]](#references) untuk mengurangi kedalaman circuit, serta simulasi klasik nilai ekspektasi [\\[1-5\\]](#references).\n"

