# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pauli propagation can be used as a lower-level engine to implement a variety of techniques. Some examples of where this has been used are:\n"
msgstr "Pauli propagation bisa dipakai sebagai mesin tingkat rendah untuk mengimplementasikan berbagai teknik. Beberapa contoh penggunaannya adalah:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lightcone shading to reduce the sampling overhead of probabilistic error cancellation (PEC) for mitigating expectation values in a 1- and 2D transverse field Ising model [\\[6\\]](#references) \\[`qiskit-addon-slc` [docs](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc)]\n"
msgstr "Lightcone shading untuk mengurangi overhead sampling dari probabilistic error cancellation (PEC) dalam memitigasi nilai ekspektasi pada model Ising medan transversal 1D dan 2D [\\[6\\]](#references) \\[`qiskit-addon-slc` [docs](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc)]\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Absorbing noise model information into a target observable to mitigate expectation values in a 2D transverse field Ising model [\\[7\\]](#references) \\[`qiskit-addon-pna` [docs](/addons/qiskit-addon-pna)]\n"
msgstr "Menyerap informasi noise model ke dalam observable target untuk memitigasi nilai ekspektasi pada model Ising medan transversal 2D [\\[7\\]](#references) \\[`qiskit-addon-pna` [docs](/addons/qiskit-addon-pna)]\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trimming trailing gates to produce lower-depth Trotter circuits for the time-evolution of a 2D spin model [\\[8\\]](#references) \\[`qiskit-addon-obp` [docs](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp)]\n"
msgstr "Memangkas gate di bagian ujung untuk menghasilkan circuit Trotter berkedalaman lebih rendah bagi evolusi waktu model spin 2D [\\[8\\]](#references) \\[`qiskit-addon-obp` [docs](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp)]\n"

